# Agent workflow

- **Stop RPS Vite before editing.** Kill the RPS dev server (port **4721**) before making code changes so HMR/reload does not slow the machine. Start it again when the human needs to playtest.
- **RPS listens on 4721 only.** Never use or fall back to 5173. Keep `vite.config` `strictPort: true` and `package.json` `dev` pinned to `--port 4721 --strictPort`.
- **Do not start other projects’ servers.** This agent works on RPS Arena only. Do not run `npm run dev` (or similar) in sibling repos such as arena-raid.
- **Free 5173 if something else grabbed it.** If port 5173 is occupied (often another project’s Vite), kill that process so it does not confuse Dave. Do not leave foreign Vite/dev servers running.
- **Do not commit or push** unless Dave explicitly asks.
- **Headless tests only.** Do not automate UI/browser testing; the human playtests the game.
